{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01H1zYGFFQu3jwrbJccvV9kG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review report submitted.\n\n**Summary**: The consolidated DREAM review of the median-tier paper yields **Overall: 2 (Reject)**, Soundness: 3, Excitement: 2.\n\nKey findings from the 2-reviewer roundtable:\n\n1. **Data provenance** is the most critical issue — only Table 1 (MATH-500 DeepSeek) and one cell of Table 2 appear to be from actual experiments; the remainder (Tables 3-6) are extrapolated/predicted with inconsistent disclosure.\n\n2. **Narrow novelty** — the contribution is an incremental empirical finding at the intersection of known effects (SparK, ThinKV, HIES) with no new method proposed.\n\n3. **Thin related work** (7 references) and **zero figures** in an 8-page empirical paper are below EMNLP standards.\n\n4. **Methodology is sound in principle** — the paired bootstrap, Wilcoxon, Bonferroni framework is appropriate. The MATH-500 dose-response result (Table 1) is the paper's genuine strength.\n\n5. **Path to resubmission**: Complete actual experiments, add figures, expand references to 25-30, report standard dz, and include a proof-of-concept phase-aware controller."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7464,"cache_read_input_tokens":70849,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7464},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b278507-b3d6-452e-b8e4-ad54eb721597","uuid":"691a93d4-37f3-4128-9e93-611463798dbd"}
